  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 2,500eb (Very Expensive)<br><strong>Enhances:</strong> Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace<br><strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace. The user's Max HP goes up by 5. It stacks with one other Epimorphic Skeleton and no more. It can't go in a Full Body Conversion and is incompatible with Titanium Bones. With two of them, the body counts as having one extra installation of Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace for Linear Frame requirements, once only.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>Max HP isn't a modifier an upgrade can apply. Add a bonuses.maxHp Active Effect to the Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace it enhances, or adjust Max HP by hand.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Internal Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
